                                            <div class="icon">
                            <i class="fa-thin fa-hospital-user"></i>
                        </div>
                    
											<p class="pre-headline xs-mb h4 ff-body theme-color-secondary">For Patients</p>
																<h2 class="mt-0 sm-mb">Get Involved</h2>
																<div class="description med-mb"><p>Information collected during this study may be used to help provide opportunities for patients and researchers to collaborate in the rare disease community.</p>
</div>
																<div class="button-wrapper">
                            <a href="https://scn2a.iamrare.org/about/for-patients/" target="" class="button" data-wpel-link="internal">Learn more</a>
                        </div>
									</div>
			</div>
			</div>
